      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，锻与炼都属于五行的金，\n所以可以改成在能提高金气的西边做重训──",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f8f348231a167ee5dae40b5b1c84d48afa5f1c1c1adaee09621079a94d4ecf",
