      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇努力不懈地想要实现梦想。\n为了能够好好支持她，\n我认真倾听她的意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0efeb75aadaf0e99a8e618c9366841f382eca1ba3f44b57a0ce99dcc322389b5",
